+/* Validate "((...))" arithmetic at p (p[0]=='(', p[1]=='(').
+ * *len set through the final ')' on success.
+ * Returns 0 valid, 1 blocked (caller: WRDE_CMDSUB),
+ * 2 malformed (caller: WRDE_SYNTAX). */
